The '''upper sprawl''' was a sprawling area of the [[city]] of [[Mos Espa]] on the [[desert]] [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. Following the [[death]] of [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure]], his [[majordomo]] [[Bib Fortuna]] assumed the title of [[lord]] and took control of [[Jabba's criminal empire]]. To maintain control, Fortuna divided Mos Espa into three families, with the [[Tatooine Klatooinian family|Klatooinian family]] controlling the upper sprawl and [[Mos Espa spaceport|spaceport]].<ref name="Chapter 3" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
"[[World Building]]" notes that [[Watto's junkshop]] and [[Mos Espa Grand Arena]] were presumably part of the upper sprawl.<ref name="World Building">{{InsiderCite|227|World Building}}</ref>

